We regard all known PPIs as positive samples, and negative samples of the same size are randomly selected from unknown interactions. In our experiment, the positive and negative sample rate is 1:1. Specifically, in the SHS27k dataset, the number of negative samples is 7624. In the SHS148k dataset, the number of negative samples is 44,488. At the same time, inspired by [
